    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        219.27659606933594,
        296.5439147949219,
        451.8705749511719,
        306.5229187011719
      ],
      "text": "India Georgia South Africa",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 8.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        322.52020263671875,
        526.5004272460938,
        333.27520751953125
      ],
      "text": "DST: drug susceptibility testing; LPA: line probe assay; NGS: next-generation sequencing; pDST: phenotypic DST;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        333.3202209472656,
        341.5276794433594,
        344.0752258300781
      ],
      "text": "RR-TB: rifampicin-resistant TB; TB: tuberculosis; tNGS: targeted NGS.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        362.59112548828125,
        179.01329040527344,
        378.9710998535156
      ],
      "text": "User perspective",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        389.2220153808594,
        527.0029296875,
        402.3670349121094
      ],
      "text": "A rapid review was commissioned to identify and synthesize qualitative evidence on the use",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        404.7220153808594,
        526.904052734375,
        417.8670349121094
      ],
      "text": "of targeted NGS for the detection of TB drug resistance; in particular, the aim was to examine",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        420.2220153808594,
        526.5632934570312,
        433.3670349121094
      ],
      "text": "the implementation considerations related to acceptability, feasibility, and values, preferences",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.987743377685547,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        435.7220153808594,
        527.025146484375,
        448.8670349121094
      ],
      "text": "and equity. The review searched Medline with no year or language limits. The search was run",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.2220153808594,
        526.9259033203125,
        464.3670349121094
      ],
      "text": "on 19 August 2022, and then rerun on 10 October 2022 to include WGS-related studies for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        466.7220153808594,
        527.319091796875,
        479.8670349121094
      ],
      "text": "the detection of TB drug resistance. The review did not identify any eligible studies for analysis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.99685001373291,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        482.2220153808594,
        526.735595703125,
        495.3670349121094
      ],
      "text": "and synthesis. Based on the systematic search, three records were identified; in addition, based",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.978379249572754,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        497.7220153808594,
        526.9634399414062,
        510.8670349121094
      ],
      "text": "on the open, hand and expert searches, 27 records were found. On full-text review of the 30",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        513.2220458984375,
        527.3466186523438,
        526.3670654296875
      ],
      "text": "records, none were found to be eligible for inclusion. Given that no direct evidence was found,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.989044189453125,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.7220458984375,
        526.9783325195312,
        541.8670654296875
      ],
      "text": "note was made of a Cochrane qualitative evidence synthesis published in 2022 that examined",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.999699592590332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        544.2220458984375,
        526.9615478515625,
        557.3670654296875
      ],
      "text": "recipient and provider perspectives on rapid molecular tests for TB and drug resistance  ;  (52)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.7220458984375,
        527.0469970703125,
        572.8670654296875
      ],
      "text": "that study provides relevant (though indirect) evidence on the subject. The authors noted",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        575.2220458984375,
        526.9974975585938,
        588.3670654296875
      ],
      "text": "that people with TB valued reaching diagnostic closure with an accurate diagnosis, avoiding",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        590.7220458984375,
        526.9371337890625,
        603.8670654296875
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic delays and keeping diagnostic associated costs low, whereas health care providers",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        606.2220458984375,
        526.9656982421875,
        619.3670654296875
      ],
      "text": "valued aspects of accuracy and the resulting confidence in low complexity NAAT results, rapid",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        621.7220458984375,
        376.1116943359375,
        634.8670654296875
      ],
      "text": "turnaround times and low costs to people seeking a diagnosis.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        645.7258911132812,
        527.092041015625,
        658.8709106445312
      ],
      "text": "To address the direct evidence gap, WHO commissioned an additional qualitative cross-sectional",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.2258911132812,
        527.279052734375,
        674.3709106445312
      ],
      "text": "study comprising semi-structured interviews, primarily with laboratory staff and management",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.996899604797363,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        676.7258911132812,
        527.013916015625,
        689.8709106445312
      ],
      "text": "personnel directly involved with implementing targeted NGS in the three FIND trial sites, as",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        692.2258911132812,
        526.9260864257812,
        705.3709106445312
      ],
      "text": "well as with three global experts involved in TB care and diagnostics. In total, there were 17",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        707.7258911132812,
        526.9478759765625,
        720.8709106445312
      ],
      "text": "respondents, and the work was conducted during September to October 2022. The objective",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        723.2258911132812,
        526.68408203125,
        736.3709106445312
      ],
      "text": "was to explore the perceptions and experiences of those implementing targeted NGS",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        738.7258911132812,
        526.9974975585938,
        751.8709106445312
      ],
      "text": "technology, with respect to acceptability, feasibility, and values, preferences and equity. The",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        754.2258911132812,
        255.1033935546875,
        767.3709106445312
      ],
      "text": "main findings are summarized below.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        556.809326171875,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 113",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}